      "cooked": "<p>So I was having a Voss fight and Ra was having not a fun time.&nbsp; He went down early in the fight.&nbsp;&nbsp; Nothing unusual there, right?&nbsp; Welllll Completionist Guise was there.&nbsp; While Ra was incapped I decided to use Guise's base power on him and swap out Setting Sun Ra with Base Ra.&nbsp; When I did that <strong>HE CAME BACK TO LIIIIIIFE</strong>...as an unknown HP target (looks like he started out with 28) that still used incap abilities.&nbsp; Gonna file a bug report, but here's a log of the amusing interaction.</p>\n<p>https://pastebin.com/Y9Vc6YXh</p>",
